   Application Technology (ESIAT 2012), Bali, INDONESIA, DEC 01-02, 2012},
Abstract = {With the tremendous development of computer technology and
   Geoinfomatics, more people are taking Vehicle Navigation System (VNS) as
   traveling assistant tool when road trip has become more popular.
   Navigation electronic map is the fundament of VNS, so there will be a
   close relationship between timely updating and navigation accuracy of
   map data. This paper reviewed the development history of navigational
   data model, summarized the advantages and disadvantages of the
   navigational data format at home and abroad, focus on the navigation
   data physical format composition, the paper proposes a new navigational
   data model oriented to the HUD, and developed experimental system based
   on Android OS, the experimental results show that the navigation data
   model is simple, practical, feasible in the navigational application for
   HUD.},
