   complicated, which is one of the challenges of electronic waste
   disposal. Firstly, the source of WPCBs, non-metallic material
   composition, current major disposal and potential dangers are analyzed
   in the research. The progress of recycling and disposal technology for
   non-mentallic materials from waste printed circuit board are summarized
